      "note": "The overflow guard only rejects n_descsz >= 0xFFFFFFFC; n_descsz=0xFFFFFFFB passes even though (n_descsz+3)&~3 = 0xFFFFFFFC makes the derived size computation wrap.",
      "role": "intermediate"
    },
